  "id": "ltd",
  "term": "LTD",
  "definition": "LTD is the weakening of synaptic connections between neurons, a form of synaptic plasticity often discussed alongside long-term potentiation in learning and memory. It is typically reflected by a decrease in measures of postsynaptic electrical response or neural population firing after stimulation.",
